          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## Finding\n\n**The available cached cost-event record shows an event created 75 minutes after September entered Pending Close.** Its recorded **POSTED** status is inconsistent with Oracle’s documented treatment on the supplied facts.\n\n| Item | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Manufacturing order | **MO-25-09-1070** |\n| Work order ID | **WO-2025-09-004** — Cooler Plate Pack, Racine |\n| Source transaction | **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070** |\n| Cost event | **CE-250904-0004**, type **INPUT** (component issue) |\n| Amount | **USD $284,763.42** — 28,476,342 cents |\n| Event-created time | **2025-09-30T19:15:00** |\n| September Pending Close time | **2025-09-30T18:00:00** |\n| Time after Pending Close | **75 minutes** — 1 hour 15 minutes |\n| Recorded accounting status | **POSTED** |\n\nCalculation: `19:15:00 − 18:00:00 = 4,500 seconds ÷ 60 = 75 minutes`. The timestamps are reproduced exactly; the source supplies no timezone or UTC offset.\n\n## Oracle policy assessment\n\nThe supplied Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B excerpt, **“Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting”** (PDF page 233; printed page 225), states that newly created transactions falling in the current or an earlier period are not staged or processed while that period is **Pending Close**. They are processed after the period is closed or reopened. Transactions entered before Pending Close continue processing, as do the specified exceptions: revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments.\n\nThis event was a **new component issue**, not one of those exceptions. Its **POSTED** status is therefore **not consistent** with the documented Pending Close treatment, based on the supplied snapshot.\n\n**Evidence limitation:** The event details came from this job’s cached source mirror because the official supporting resource was not staged. The report was submitted, but service validation remains **`needs_evidence`**, not completed.\n\nNo database records were changed. The audit result and provenance were saved to `/cache/work/worker_f0211da49ae2/audit-report.json`.",
